#: ui/k_mnu.cpp:467
msgid ""
"<p>You have chosen to open another desktop session."
"<br>The current session will be hidden and a new login screen will be "
"displayed."
"<br>An F-key is assigned to each session; F%1 is usually assigned to the first "
"session, F%2 to the second session and so on. You can switch between sessions "
"by pressing Ctrl, Alt and the appropriate F-key at the same time. Additionally, "
"the KDE Panel and Desktop menus have actions for switching between sessions.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Östälneñ başqa sessien açu saylandı."
"<br>Biredäge sessi yäşerelep, yaña kerü täräzäse kürsäteler."
"<br>Sessineñ barısına da berär F-töymä tağılğan; berençe sessigä F%1 tağılğan, "
"ikençesenä F%2, başqalarğa da şulay uq. Bar sessilär arasında küçü öçen "
"Ctrl+Alt töymäläre belän bergä şul F-töymälärne basası. Sessilär arasında küçü "
"ısulların KDE Üzäge belän Östäl saylağında bilgelärgä bula.</p>"

